WEBVTT

00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:24.940
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> Hi Emma.

00:00:26.422 --> 00:00:27.528
I’m back.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.398
Where are you?

00:00:40.515 --> 00:00:42.260
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> I’m upstairs in the bedroom.

00:00:42.713 --> 00:00:43.715
I’m packing.

00:00:44.539 --> 00:00:45.294
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> Packing?

00:00:46.302 --> 00:00:47.004
Why?

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.180
Where are you going?

00:00:50.494 --> 00:00:52.360
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> I’m going to stay with my mum.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.140
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> Your mum?

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:58.675
What’s happened?

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.260
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> She’s had an accident.

00:01:01.684 --> 00:01:04.280
She fell over in the street and she’s broken her leg.

00:01:05.699 --> 00:01:06.580
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> How awful.

00:01:09.086 --> 00:01:09.820
Poor thing.

00:01:11.062 --> 00:01:12.380
Shall I make you a cup of tea?

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.180
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> That’d be lovely, thanks…

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:29.700
I’ve told my work I need the time off.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.380
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> How long do you think you’ll have to stay?

00:01:36.302 --> 00:01:40.460
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> I won’t come back… until the weekend, I don’t think.

00:01:41.742 --> 00:01:45.620
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> Sorry, until when?

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:47.940
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Until the weekend.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.700
I’ll have to make sure she’s OK.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:57.667
I’ve taken the children to my sister’s.

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:05.340
She’ll take them to school tomorrow morning.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.060
Can you pick them up after school?

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:10.180
<v><b>Jack:</b></v> Of course I can.

00:02:10.798 --> 00:02:13.600
Now don’t worry about anything.

00:02:14.222 --> 00:02:14.670
OK?

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:17.200
Everything is going to be fine.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:22.446
Here’s your tea and I’ll take your case downstairs.

00:02:22.891 --> 00:02:23.678
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Thanks, Jack.

00:02:28.532 --> 00:02:30.700
The taxi’ll be here in five minutes.